%% Placement into the finished 1911 master (engine 1.31, November 2026)
flowchart TD
  A[Re-fitted sheet: finished raster + ledger + approved packet] --> B{Evidence from the similarity fit?<br/>review schema 4, ledger says similarity}
  B -- no --> X1[Refuse: old three-point evidence]
  B -- yes --> C{Baked file exists and its corners match<br/>the finished raster within a pixel?}
  C -- yes --> D[Place the baked file]
  C -- no --> E[Place the finished raster<br/>warn: color differs until baked]
  D --> F[Generated QGIS code, plan embedded as data]
  E --> F
  F --> G{Open project has unsaved changes?}
  G -- yes --> X2[Refuse, change nothing]
  G -- no --> H{Sheet already has a layer in a quadrant folder?<br/>matched by layer name and tile number;<br/>INSET MAPS and helper layers ignored}
  H -- yes --> I[Replace that layer's source in place]
  H -- no --> J[Insert in printed-number order<br/>in the right quadrant folder]
  I --> K[Verify style: brightness 0, contrast 0, gamma 1, no stretch]
  J --> K
  K --> L{Every check passed and the master file untouched?}
  L -- no --> R[Roll back tree, sources and styles]
  L -- yes --> M[Done. Never saves the master.]
  F -. check-only .-> N[Run every check, report add or replace, change nothing]
